  "wikitext": "Orbit can be showed by using <code>$$orbit</code>. It shows the status of [[space station]] and the active [[relic]]s in the [[quantum vault]].\n\n== Space station ==\n\nWhen you have not built a [[space station]], it shows \"''Not built''\".\n\nIf you have the space station, it shows your space station level, Expedition Points that your got from [[Galactic Expedition]] and the damage your space station received.\n\n== Quantum Vault ==\n\nWhen you have not any active [[relic]]s in the [[quantum vault]], it shows \"''No active relics''\"",
