  "renderedTitle": "Orbit",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p>Orbit can be showed by using <code>$$orbit</code>. It shows the status of <a href=\"/index.php/Space_station\" title=\"Space station\">space station</a> and the active <a href=\"/index.php/Relic\" title=\"Relic\">relics</a> in the <a href=\"/index.php/Quantum_vault\" title=\"Quantum vault\">quantum vault</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Space_station\">Space station</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Orbit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Space station\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When you have not built a <a href=\"/index.php/Space_station\" title=\"Space station\">space station</a>, it shows \"<i>Not built</i>\".\n</p><p>If you have the space station, it shows your space station level, Expedition Points that your got from <a href=\"/index.php/Galactic_Expedition\" title=\"Galactic Expedition\">Galactic Expedition</a> and the damage your space station received.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quantum_Vault\">Quantum Vault</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Orbit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Quantum Vault\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When you have not any active <a href=\"/index.php/Relic\" title=\"Relic\">relics</a> in the <a href=\"/index.php/Quantum_vault\" title=\"Quantum vault\">quantum vault</a>, it shows \"<i>No active relics</i>\"\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261008211832\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.000 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expans